  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00002",
      "source_hash": "3ed1afe0c7eae2ec408908af0659735170b1add8492590fe27a4f9fdd2af4246",
      "target_id": "XML:2703300",
      "text": "罚款附加金的计算标准与计算程序（与第六十条之二第六款相关）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00003",
      "source_hash": "eb4f3ced21174bce81005b0955673910bbd0d0f80f87489fa47429738b9f0a8a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703301",
      "text": "1. 罚款附加金的计算阶段"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "6c15bd5b92952d5a785105e05ca372651497943883dee5cd1b9899b24b292696",
      "target_id": "XML:2703302",
      "text": "综合考虑本法第六十四条之二第四款各号规定的事项及影响这些事项的行为，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "0dfb19d7e1a2c5f42e35e51695eeb5d145f8b50286040daae30137c075258407",
      "target_id": "XML:2703303",
      "text": "按照第二号甲目计算基准金额，再依同号乙目进行"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00006",
      "source_hash": "4785f56e31955ed7a0d55674475a2dbb6455a4db8f1e17f631d0a688ef964d74",
      "target_id": "XML:2703304",
      "text": "第一次调整、依同号丙目进行第二次调整，并依同号戊目确定应征收的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "0ceeebbbc2d35a9be1e1c431601cdf8c3fda6642aa02363e05ccb2d8b8e7094a",
      "target_id": "XML:2703305",
      "text": "罚款附加金，依次完成上述阶段。但即使加重征收，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00008",
      "source_hash": "ee6f4e54cbf386c8644c7238c51d0d5c66cb45937a08be7fc9bb75fe5e69ad8c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703306",
      "text": "也不得超过本法第六十四条之二第一款各号以外部分规定的罚款附加金金额上限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00009",
      "source_hash": "b0b7df3250314acfcc83c6e199a3b8bd364aff13e39c644a46c1c090c1e32163",
      "target_id": "XML:2703307",
      "text": "2. 各计算阶段的计算方法及考虑因素"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00010",
      "source_hash": "71ab1429acc27ee46ac372e393f7aa982af0bf889e5e4a94ea31f08e67b37739",
      "target_id": "XML:2703308",
      "text": "甲. 基准金额的计算"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "1f472e9e3924775cad9ba774565fc11792a0b5b73c9bfe72f4d50b2a9c3d9005",
      "target_id": "XML:2703309",
      "text": "1）从第六十条之二第一款规定的总销售额中扣除同条第三款规定的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "476d96cb34328b47a0074b39ff5a223c0f11bc62c312e2ef5790eb25b2709aea",
      "target_id": "XML:2703310",
      "text": "与违法行为无关的销售额，对剩余销售额按照违法行为的严重程度"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "dd4412f6f96a621204363ffa6d3b656544cfac76d4c65249be871bb7810ce41d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703311",
      "text": "乘以下列罚款附加金计算比率（以下简称“征收基准比率”），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00014",
      "source_hash": "40f579f9e0d1a619d8413ae027dc6479ef198f7cd3f6701077e5d5bab6d5bd4b",
      "target_id": "XML:2703312",
      "text": "所得金额即为基准金额。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "44c201ba96f0f3b9b99965dffc6b5fd9dc45a1ca72bf96469e3f372c4aaa492c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703313",
      "text": "违法行为的严重程度"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00016",
      "source_hash": "1e516bf6312a8ca1860c6951ad37d7b206dbb1708171a4addffc0554788212ac",
      "target_id": "XML:2703314",
      "text": "征收基准比率"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00018",
      "source_hash": "d6c63c780553547940b0fc82a59343c3ee3a0ae5bec8238beb6345d286891b6d",
      "target_id": "XML:2703316",
      "text": "2.1%以上、2.7%以下"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00020",
      "source_hash": "917a72e3c36f172c372d188460c6746a5f7969f95465b4975e4dc24e736df6c5",
      "target_id": "XML:2703318",
      "text": "1.5%以上、不满2.1%"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00022",
      "source_hash": "c5aad9bae5fb8f461f2ef56ccdbf2a0d8361d214ee506339afd9d4ac9204ec1e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703320",
      "text": "0.9%以上、不满1.5%"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00024",
      "source_hash": "0d4b615aceeebc3f1fd4ec51f907f3f95dd7d41f2ca80137f5d50fa64d267bd4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703322",
      "text": "0.03%以上、不满0.9%"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00025",
      "source_hash": "d34feb81ba7ac0a6cba4b128bcd49682f798640eb8a8d886abf3a701d13715fa",
      "target_id": "XML:2703323",
      "text": "2）属于第六十条之二第二款各号之一的情形时，不适用上述第1）项，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00026",
      "source_hash": "8d35614f5801c337d85aefd95ad6cf59a5356a646bddebc9ddbbe5a9ed3cb7f2",
      "target_id": "XML:2703324",
      "text": "而依违法行为的严重程度按下表确定基准金额。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "44c201ba96f0f3b9b99965dffc6b5fd9dc45a1ca72bf96469e3f372c4aaa492c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703325",
      "text": "违法行为的严重程度"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "e0cb9e9c413a3b9bfab1103e4675c0de90c7ee8cbab46c0e05b8e9dd58a12c60",
      "target_id": "XML:2703326",
      "text": "基准金额"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00030",
      "source_hash": "3b03aba37641a3bcbd23027c7cc28858e78a85f5248787cce81ec8e6ca73c551",
      "target_id": "XML:2703328",
      "text": "7亿韩元以上、18亿韩元以下"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00032",
      "source_hash": "7585da4b46071c5a2d817ad3e7dc44587e88e44d826db829e8700209137d6442",
      "target_id": "XML:2703330",
      "text": "2亿韩元以上、不满7亿韩元"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "d5ffa456b56c7c43dbca3e37cd66c517905c75068ff678fd7dd747f49dcf737e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703332",
      "text": "5,000万韩元以上、不满2亿韩元"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "f7d0f90485bb6f09a75b31a96138a455b91b0e5b457e645423fbbad41d5a7207",
      "target_id": "XML:2703334",
      "text": "500万韩元以上、不满5,000万韩元"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "0a4f8f54ae1f8a7b5d91be76d8d19e28a6b2adb6c3bed8315b14254612806490",
      "target_id": "XML:2703335",
      "text": "3）综合考虑以下事项判断违法行为的严重程度。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "1fff3812ae4da5557dacb9363d45e06e0e06477e60891e4019494e610ea70d1c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703336",
      "text": "甲）违法行为的内容与程度"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "a3757699e8ec9cf650ffa9c217956affa704a8c14ec58e61b40971f331ba8c00",
      "target_id": "XML:2703337",
      "text": "乙）采取加密等安全保障措施的努力"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37056-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "77d8e5a9ebb2359715b617c2231851f52ffe4336850def076a5d6134add06732",
      "target_id": "XML:2703338",
      "text": "丙）个人信息发生丢失、被盗、泄露、伪造、篡改或损坏时，该违法行为与"
    }
  ],
  "note": "A37056 1-40 Korean source table and prose verified: surcharge 64-2 basis, base amount, adjustments sequence, 2.1-2.7/1.5-2.1/0.9-1.5/0.03-0.9 percent, 7-18/2-7/etc hundred-million KRW thresholds. Annex incomplete."
